  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-25T04:18:02.661Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been playing VRChat for almost 300 hours and i'm still a \"User\", almost 100 avatars uploaded and a few worlds. I noticed to rank up you need to add friends, I don't really socialise in VRChat or use my microphone because I'm shy and have social anxiety and I don't like the restriction of having to add people to be seen as a trusted player.\n\nI feel as if the ranks should only work through playtime, activity and avatar uploading.\n\nAnd yes, I understand it's called VR\"Chat\" but some people play it for exploration and drawing, not inherently \"talking\" or \"chatting\".",
